      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW VINE (4) is a handy type who was well below best latest at this track, finishing seventh (30.97) in a Grade 5. Normally safe to begin but shuffled back last time off the low draw. Better than last start and worth following up. NICMAC ACE (5) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 9 lengths at this track (30.74). Likely to be thereabouts. LET'S CAUSE KAOS (1) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last six runs. Last time finished 3rd over 600m at this track beaten 8 lengths (34.91) behind Whiskey Whiskers in a Grade 4/5 on September 2. The form out of her last race has been franked. Overdue and expected to feature again. BELAIR BETTY (2) looks an each-way chance.",
